= Epistemics =
Epistemics concerns the quality, source, justification, uncertainty, and verification of knowledge claims.

BITwiki uses epistemic metadata to help readers and machines distinguish established information, supported interpretation, preliminary findings, hypotheses, disputed claims, historical positions, and deprecated material.

See [[BITwiki:Epistemics]] for the project framework.

